{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "source_mode": "sha256-utf8",
  "resource": "MC2Game/Localization/Coalesced.int",
  "input_sha256": "179e265cfc9e6d3e9f2586abe75b5da303b2af9b8484079851dab72f9f7edb8c",
  "entries": [
    {
      "id": "coalesced:d62cb383856d7d4b1a416c459e34f82e0db0f7a05cdfdfb7fedde05e62c5496d",
      "source_sha256": "a3a390ee57ec523798ace15bea73a26f48ad405bfd38da2d10e7e02f7c7c0ba5",
      "translation": "第一次见到你时，为什么会觉得面熟，我现在终于明白了。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:947bae1f9bb20e4ad03b06d1ebb0c36e047f2919623657fc3a87a9ddbdf3b07b",
      "source_sha256": "ddb998a48089e140d9cfb9d76928938b8e530dec8478dc951a8dd427d9aa31d3",
      "translation": "因为我曾经差点死在你手里。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:e972e5213d2807335a82b0ab4e23304847b4cc035920e74d822d4bef68cf4db2",
      "source_sha256": "3fc49bc5e910a5aa191b705dbea04151b2fbc68d6ac397230ee5d6272a9f6a8e",
      "translation": "所以才会本能地察觉到，你就是艾尔加吧。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:ee4796968995cbca06456f8a0958ff8e559fdd47e34986e4ed8705984a2fdb9b",
      "source_sha256": "895361ffbf88d5a8c40d47f8dd3d03df2042ca9360d08738bcbb4faa39495404",
      "translation": "……"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:a3ffca13c996b32b6c0028564541b5e0afd26426be53b0dc3ffdbfa0ba69d86b",
      "source_sha256": "c3838bf02a9eafc6dcd300966cc1b2f0d14b28c332676bf5456a806771afdc70",
      "translation": "现在该坦白了吧。你到底是谁？为什么会和艾尔加长着同一张脸？",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:444ccbf9efc4473298991cfbb9621f45c1e2a274ee8aa76c2d95fa651da39409",
      "source_sha256": "97dfda82de9a070589b010feeaa2355809acb00494d032d259d3eda2c418d931",
      "translation": "我自己也很混乱。为什么还会有一个和我一模一样的家伙……",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:f3c788a633e0713fc3cac65ff0d7f250e7959ab6c5d92b720760a9aa20baabb5",
      "source_sha256": "daaa300d79cd07fb2de579d5fb01d1d7ccdca201fad2f21eb198181223256791",
      "translation": "但就像你们想的，我的确是那个差点杀死洁菲的屠杀者艾尔加。……唯独这一点，不会有错。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:7432ab38ffbfcb112a79bc087709fad30705e50b182333d824044442ed7dd224",
      "source_sha256": "2a00b0ad9a41bc55c2641f166aa9460fa89ad8940d88543eaf4bfa71cbd637f1",
      "translation": "我不会辩解。所以，想报仇就动手吧。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:4e34aac0650a34d69fba36c4af4d6e5a3594ccc7f8c59dab0360e42c07dd7e88",
      "source_sha256": "55c11f230cf5a2a82daf9fb83e153983a49bb6dde61596066351194c42decaa6",
      "translation": "是的。即使你不说，我也早已下定决心，再见到你时，绝不会轻易放过你。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:f7b48d2df48d765645ba5aafb9e39555e67942e5ff57746df33f1c5044fc8015",
      "source_sha256": "cb0135717e99d2977110f5df7e5fb55c55d00f83d2112aa630e590dedc6150c9",
      "translation": "等一下……"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:6eb25c118a5767946647fc4703ae97aae59f74052663e62cff7795653c34d715",
      "source_sha256": "801614124a5e05e7584fbe0a4f4a1a5772dbebb0c0d13d9e84cf680d020eb824",
      "translation": "可朱特哥哥以前也是我们的同伴啊。就算他曾经是艾尔加……",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:970a9bca2d783fa8407f3b4d258559bbd875100881757fa88455951a8dc859fd",
      "source_sha256": "39fd9caf65dcc140e8de7216ae44fb34fffdbbe82e59fc28f438476990ed0b6e",
      "translation": "死在艾尔加手里的人，不计其数。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:be1729995c016f8d99eea589b62a9d6b58ac58c9d829fb3d2a7bf63d10059f22",
      "source_sha256": "e9ed96b59b2112aaeccf4e049ac0a450142d6a9b76a00c278a4d3b74affeccca",
      "translation": "甚至在开战之前，他就曾奉修恩扎伊特之命，暗杀反对派的贵族。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:d98983998cb936d1c40f4a3192605fce86c0203da7b31e7b95b2b56cf7140a80",
      "source_sha256": "9c68b6f055e167a6d431b4646c9bc39ea4fc10cff96b0000ec07d61ba432288a",
      "translation": "很遗憾，失去记忆，并不意味着他做过的事就能一笔勾销。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:453076727b478acb3770d7e696e1d77cf6a86301aeff387310d6a0faed03d972",
      "source_sha256": "14dc4e2ce5b02b90104f4dd0483b63557f4dc0dd330eabf5f0e20c2b86779288",
      "translation": "那不也一样吗？朱特哥哥一直都在帮助我们啊。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:c8552827937423b382fdfc46b9d7f4ade928c01fef113983c3f2e4b0537fa491",
      "source_sha256": "db06f7c7a6b3661faaa9943b74d4f771af270390d6a8153b8f79a5de09fa5b2a",
      "translation": "不能因为哥哥是艾尔加，就把他帮助过我们的事一笔勾销啊！",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:14ebf381b6df5d98aaaad0fb721e2357dda2cec6175dbdf18cd32f54a6b5175b",
      "source_sha256": "895361ffbf88d5a8c40d47f8dd3d03df2042ca9360d08738bcbb4faa39495404",
      "translation": "……"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:e110356ab1bc44786e71ea4fcb2cc3459d6ca561067104cbd41f92315ece9938",
      "source_sha256": "25cfb998a20d76175ddba850166db56be2fc9133bbf476b86d4288f677d08f7c",
      "translation": "想想朱特哥哥做过的事。他救过洁菲姐姐，我们能一次次打赢北部军，也都是多亏了哥哥啊。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:2593b1430006744f0bbb6104ee4cf6a4aa5e9d34af802c02356a44fd8552a843",
      "source_sha256": "21b4e3e752bd055f587bd9353506a33d3b2facc6b789b676db0aba8110c7aab9",
      "translation": "当然，我也……讨厌艾尔加。因为艾尔加杀了很多马雷族人。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:ce1adba9bcd79fdb6f22d96e3cf03afd5bf2786b873e8f691d66be0fb34dddf3",
      "source_sha256": "8c8e053a0057d410f8d5ad1a2065418a6214d047939ad63f2d0664c0c6fd0053",
      "translation": "可是，一直以来，大家不都接受了朱特哥哥原本的样子吗？",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:b4fa9b5f76e43823f937ac945531b6320e787c739e1f16fd6aaad7d8dffb5490",
      "source_sha256": "14f3ed3954be8a2496ea0d36fa15743b1e4f975a328a4a375c599968b520d334",
      "translation": "如果不知道他是艾尔加，你们现在就不会这样了吧。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:2bf2916fd51f24cbd9ffcfee5e93f12dd63c5cc6fca238efcc5f992e05698c00",
      "source_sha256": "e8da81d6691feee59b7ac8f04ded568f51c1522fe410977695ec9a132a6f4d29",
      "translation": "事到如今，我不想只把朱特哥哥看作艾尔加……",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:aad2e4842743e5f61e50f05f671f040496ac025edfb6b11a8737b2bade87f3d6",
      "source_sha256": "895361ffbf88d5a8c40d47f8dd3d03df2042ca9360d08738bcbb4faa39495404",
      "translation": "……"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:8637bc0289ceefd300ca397d8ef8b8921da26dfb875f0aa68e1c3d67be30f124",
      "source_sha256": "4a7ad0c771385c063dbd6faef50829eeb2330a6f39ec7fbcc73bd759281436fe",
      "translation": "朱特，你还记得那天的事吗？就是你差点杀了我和公主殿下的时候。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:6a1859cef1abfa3b2f7693999e76f1f0d8b90d6355f4c67564a4ae93f804f410",
      "source_sha256": "d39909a9c374f3c47eab19e3f561dc770c22d469e1092c7eee767ae720810ed2",
      "translation": "记得。我奉修恩扎伊特之命追杀你，要除掉窃取哨兵情报的你……",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:60fed27923698b274f751dad228250f2fd2f78f21181021a8d04213097cc432f",
      "source_sha256": "895361ffbf88d5a8c40d47f8dd3d03df2042ca9360d08738bcbb4faa39495404",
      "translation": "……"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:ea73db612d97d99ac660880d633ce287de4052cf555804fb04e2d056aba8b23a",
      "source_sha256": "2755d9031d420ac90861fc117bc0cfea76615dcca878283e60802ed03903d91f",
      "translation": "那时，我接到的命令是……绝对不能杀死洁菲。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:3eea0e67520ed5e9909ed25ef57a32abb1b2646c80e4a2fb5f25f98f29c0d4fe",
      "source_sha256": "608d79886b9b7e6784dda26603cd8baefb7023aae014a1e0f9e13917e8465750",
      "translation": "可洁菲为了保护你挺身而出，我失手刺中了她。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:5720aea77e998f51c89010c721671ffa53d6f88a2ed849bc3fdc5ff594209344",
      "source_sha256": "b2a215e4ebbf2b08b9797c8497a5a42101e843dbcff90f46bc2d2ef1d620f410",
      "translation": "虽然并非本意，但那是我第一次违抗修恩扎伊特的命令。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:d6fb217289a2f3f32fb0454dcb3da47d58e062c8fbe175096a7d6cee832da93a",
      "source_sha256": "5f662543e804f4163737a88278abaf278aab064af83f0d7be023cdc2196ef43c",
      "translation": "没有杀死洁菲……实在太好了。可我也在那时崩溃了。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:0a9a2fab5bdf45675e7158fdb46d63d8b8cf2f3841601acee2176edf5f61d703",
      "source_sha256": "423fb0154fa26acf8fc919299aa83cf792097e02e1e26950dfe863d3de1f3879",
      "translation": "违抗命令导致我的自我崩溃，最后连记忆都失去了。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:fb02446ee2eb5896e689f4715966370308fdd0f6389100cecb0b5e522881a2c9",
      "source_sha256": "dcd8ec7679260e6b1f8f075eba0afb76222eb758eec459fa373c0b9e341cf9ba",
      "translation": "修恩扎伊特下过命令，不许杀死公主殿下？这是什么意思？",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:516cacb47869d064b17b3d2ee3fa7af8c00435c0e91d9da43e57da2c9dca22d8",
      "source_sha256": "334a8529f4ae3703bfd7097d87719d1928f1922c10e70cb838f6721e75212a4f",
      "translation": "谁知道……谁知道，我也不明白。我只是接到了命令。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:e47b7aac7e36b9d6205fba3406177fd0448cfb12674738d2cd55fba1e7be2d06",
      "source_sha256": "6ac47f2936d118928a7cda3763973aec2fcaa0df13876fd6f82821a417ff32f9",
      "translation": "哦，是吗？所以你又照着命令行动，眼睁睁让公主被绑走了？",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:fea51f45c9610d05e39afb62c1adfe187ac86993d6032cd5ad63957ed7f2e901",
      "source_sha256": "de8e780f293d0c14c6cfa547532c87f76225ab8a0e775e59c0e56984b5bbd76e",
      "translation": "对不起……"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:dbf47a4d52c86e02ddd0c14ef46a1413b9f0a814a29a3763826e8044b3fc8c5e",
      "source_sha256": "ab958f48ea91cd2d622d592e7107caf688353c6666f6a1b151f125190c12bdf8",
      "translation": "我……无论如何，我杀过很多南部军，也曾差点杀了洁菲和露。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:67645bcf62cf503de6105e3c5090e0003491c4b528dfc02aa15acc4b54dd9a8c",
      "source_sha256": "403572c781d2de2eeafd3b520c714cd4c9eebeaf95f5925dc2dbf16647733930",
      "translation": "如果你们想向我报仇……我不会反抗。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:06b1ecf8c1997bfbe7d01d88846d05a9f9d651bce296c45d8fcff788fcd52ec9",
      "source_sha256": "29c55b9b3f2f29bd925e1bf13d467426bb9b9c7766ec1bcc8dc996375e79a8a5",
      "translation": "但是……能不能再给我一点时间？虽然大家都没办法相信我……",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:8f85946d56cdc76a24a3289db3db5e18930dbd695a7a5fb4f3d8d7e3cdd65726",
      "source_sha256": "9a5ccf2d6b7dd84f2cf9dad2cbbd522f9b4f9e7acb46f07255c3f94f780046ce",
      "translation": "至少洁菲，我想亲手把她救出来。哪怕只是为了赎罪……",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:2d300cf3bbcede99b6222b83083db129bce02a0853e85f26116201655f722d6b",
      "source_sha256": "73e4720998f5c52679b7dcb67e85791dfd18890933f28f4f22675a230a9ef7a6",
      "translation": "哥哥……我们当然要一起去啊。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:4d2d887c7db80e5f7cb2217e5da42ce310c1ddf0d2fe1c57fe350c75450c5d60",
      "source_sha256": "88f1073144aa85e249c2895c281c1c7af5733fc1deb18152e6304b5bc0efffe3",
      "translation": "是啊。同伴之间不能争斗。这种时候才更应该齐心协力。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:7ea4ca171dd9404b71fe40dd8da1d94147aaa3207fec5643c5daac4751df38a4",
      "source_sha256": "bb45a159da4582ec173cb13b5c074752222185b7793dd985b394438cc39cf060",
      "translation": "朱特，我明白你的想法，但还是没办法轻易相信你。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:939292c3d7b4ba07be8031143c7db865524cb57fcb99bc49608122f17381e147",
      "source_sha256": "e6c3f84fa9ef2105b41ef8dda21efe4e8c10344f5038ba4bb55481ae305a2c9d",
      "translation": "没错。谁知道你什么时候又会被操纵？",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:715904c746fcad15bac21040705768af0492a77196321f0d1752bd09b82116ff",
      "source_sha256": "ae37b87e5d860f283de4fb086fa6fffd9f0b25863aa395661297fc724e36c52e",
      "translation": "却要我们相信这样的你，一起去救公主？",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:90765b6f2e2a083ff15cbbcbcc7695493968cfe37e5762be18de2e976d00d525",
      "source_sha256": "895361ffbf88d5a8c40d47f8dd3d03df2042ca9360d08738bcbb4faa39495404",
      "translation": "……"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:fdb64d2d792cb327fa1693c479f5f96d12d51017e17b27d389e74a43bfe83d0b",
      "source_sha256": "4b2f87b85968756a01523f3d744ee02aec95f52cae01c17deaf2440fdbe53fa8",
      "translation": "那么，到时候……就杀了我。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:ae2ff9b03e4e732ad81a21041203e837af5c3b413d4e1801dcc60dce98e7043d",
      "source_sha256": "233d26e97f6469a0a7e0369bfb9ff2504cc5e0037df310c7600d18d62deebce4",
      "translation": "！！"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:8e5349d119fd31b89121ca25951e88b4d796ec11fed0fd8d88567d874ca36980",
      "source_sha256": "119b2e67328af7f7c9331b82b4d0494cc445219ec4196e3475fdfdd39663453c",
      "translation": "如果我再次被那家伙的命令支配，拖累了你们，到那时就杀了我。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:94ac9c8afe5374a92b77bd4b427681b8d1a0a2727bb9764390785772a339802a",
      "source_sha256": "3345fc6c9b3c771ba74b5dfe8cb2b3919083cc2e20a7063fa233a029502d725a",
      "translation": "你怎么能说这种话？我们是同伴啊，哥哥！",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:b80112ec05ff37e707cf8672f2fc881e41d2b099dcef0734ad9e0a1cc9f2ad8f",
      "source_sha256": "b6c1e51dd73a451cf7a8819eea7ff2f39eb74778c0cc9be6bc091ede6586d2eb",
      "translation": "如果我发狂了，到那时就不再是同伴，而只是你们的敌人。这是为了以防万一……",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:eb51728b7930928e91cafe748ddccda4065ae416051b6f2f1c4b2709ebeebf4c",
      "source_sha256": "63ee0195d492d375df8eeb3fdec137b6bc4a2cced5178c10387b8a216dee878b",
      "translation": "别相信我。因为我……连我自己都没办法相信自己。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:6a6ef685ca6bfea43ed3ca7b6f08c76ac62d09c8ed9c6fa7cdddfff2d6d0d52c",
      "source_sha256": "91b9eff247d79196a473650595e9d1549b8f6715a32de8699edd38f812d68450",
      "translation": "可恶……那你别再被那家伙支配不就行了！",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:4e37a37a043d018250768088b221c07e0f8dfa13e6076b8b009a044bb860d379",
      "source_sha256": "a2607eb25abb7798c8d8bd63b6b390fbf0be74ecf7194a419d28df94ff1974e2",
      "translation": "我也想……可是……“血之契约”的烙印无法抹去。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:00a9633e82c017b1af23f4316f37f3593d706c67abd2028d563b2aee2e750c92",
      "source_sha256": "1e0085905b0287776655249c8f8d0109198091757870a8bf9bc13e8a47686897",
      "translation": "我明白了。就这么办吧。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:04ed2f497cb000052834699fd0ade32d5f14058f2090125b8c8f670d4cd99342",
      "source_sha256": "81b61183e27745ce719314d0990e619e6fe65f4fd8ce639417dfb89ac3e0520f",
      "translation": "只要我判断你对我们有一丝危险，那一刻，就是你的死期。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:a70e479559b2b1f7a6861b57990a26f6aa5420b56a3a38477d2c60977dda7b6e",
      "source_sha256": "30a6202da04b98aa4c688b194c2713d7e72f9c54ccb3f627d499ea3705531f37",
      "translation": "听起来或许很冷酷，但对我而言，公主殿下的性命远比你重要。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:5a58142a517d0669ddfa71d7d62eb8f2969bba75ccdff8f220e80489325b0569",
      "source_sha256": "6b34b98034d5c4ac37505eca06af152434f7f1645c4707adb6ec935df872595a",
      "translation": "好。就这么做吧。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:336ecb7ec6d69e4b08472233d9c7884fd10ebfc746eb7468dd5660f83270b604",
      "source_sha256": "2975aeaa0bf9bc9e6adc085de22447a4ac0e89fd0bed22f6502c75e6807593c2",
      "translation": "不过，如果可以，我还是希望那种事不要发生。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:0d0a97380872d510062708175adb5bf877ff19591e816cc27c89633c8069215d",
      "source_sha256": "082457a22028fe600a06cb1a1d21d5e855eda8d6cafd38ca91287af2eded2ba7",
      "translation": "你已经帮过我们很多次了。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:1498e14b2983ea37127ea349f513bb756b6f8aa0bf00c5712be33c6ddca7d4dc",
      "source_sha256": "659253fae0ea8e745fdd939e6536eac01aa8b7282c22ca29b365598bb9653ea0",
      "translation": "正如塞蕾丝汀所说，就算你是艾尔加，也抹不掉你曾是朱特的事实。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:0c4d1724cb0b62d40b2c48b80848beab6b91c39d079e8618f1e54712ef43610d",
      "source_sha256": "d5599e32bc24e3df7407e28213ed133f9a31a40ff46ee8471bf92fb43b204849",
      "translation": "我还想再相信你一段时间。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:11775d8e2eab5c237d50a221be69fff8921c365691559f1e5239dc0839a4b582",
      "source_sha256": "81ed13ec092122ddd754b8897cb44749df262b94f96fe168643409f598e6cd70",
      "translation": "谢谢……"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:b884713f22cc847b87c51521251de1c9c19bf3a5dea9d0b47ebc11384a261ae8",
      "source_sha256": "300e06d0659e2395177fe3b0f093b794edb71d3d5a4a154bc37b392b0f798f2d",
      "translation": "我一直相信，即使找不回失去的记忆，我也依然是我。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:3a1e085b62911d3bf1ac5a7301a66d3c05f53bcca985134d6b0ad9fff46f40ad",
      "source_sha256": "b9b49341be7aa558d580e72ae6779b28dd4a184759d5422ffbf24e07f1c9b57a",
      "translation": "然而，那段沾满鲜血与罪孽的过去，却成了我无论如何也挣脱不了的枷锁。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:ca92b438880792cf0548fdc3865e9033bb0ccda2306a76d8d9d5c39bfe47be31",
      "source_sha256": "2ef98473831adb786d3b7de110085f598b3d5b40424116e44806c953fc26dd29",
      "translation": "那么，就算我失忆之前……曾经是公主殿下的敌人，您也愿意相信我吗？",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:3751742637fadb56e6d177b5313d967b5e5d7fc25a3ea9c23c9f5c96de559026",
      "source_sha256": "2d172282a350b776de4730bb7eb28db6acd10fb7795dfe80a93b0b33909e65f9",
      "translation": "不管过去如何，朱特就是朱特。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:2c0d3992bf394174cf38ba58611dd11a9fd687606c9c3e642415d2f43e242792",
      "source_sha256": "2f20dacfe79097ed96b89d18556bae17df00ef48e52e5757b76c4ef847b0fa8f",
      "translation": "我会相信朱特……一直相信。我保证。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:bb08d0b3640f02d78acf69aa4cec17e55d857ce57d89dce3f4cf30e2f003f3f4",
      "source_sha256": "b0553550263b1da67f9eebf643af260939f24b90bd3e43c2a9526afe7688dcb4",
      "translation": "曾经拯救过我的，是洁菲的安慰。我大概再也听不到那样的话了吧。我该怎么办才好，洁菲……？",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:5cfb200f718d898368f5a0c5cd68635ee1bfc11bb2ba457b8191f3d376229f9d",
      "source_sha256": "4f45107bc366a4752634f97cd0bf1825ea7b9c57c0234685d21a3f642afe53b4",
      "translation": "洁菲被带往北方了，应该是去贝尔福特。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:b9d6a0e3bf5613bebd2845e954af7b35ff750e03accfecaeb5cabce9b93dd49f",
      "source_sha256": "5327d1138fa0adf3407c9c79b8a36b45006f62599fb3fd2a0b65386360bda15e",
      "translation": "我们快走。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:05f06266fb3701acb85f075f17ebfa96597f5e0ea0c0179d3bde20c94f4f7473",
      "source_sha256": "599ca05c5c92f13b159a1c70e8fd2d4aa055dcc6210157d591b801004ebdbb58",
      "translation": "嗯！一定要把洁菲姐姐救出来。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:855d08360794e1a2484fd1ab4f28e0dfdc943edf617b81bf6ad940f618f03757",
      "source_sha256": "8ea9afec8e26fda73d47502003abfdbb25b4d33c975c197a0393c99f79975c0b",
      "translation": "对了！为了报答你们救了我，以后就让你们使用我们的阿维斯运输队吧～",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:bc6333cc5ed34b3c8d9cea703ef874909ee1e87cb08c442077f8abae01f84b57",
      "source_sha256": "80c922b5137adc6ddb5bc86de75e1db6429948c92951f287719db5c898ab8094",
      "translation": "来，请收下。凭这张票，就能终身使用阿维斯运输队。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:5b816a192c7ab5ae9c4f50ef333d6945af7bfedc29089154be863767b70f168b",
      "source_sha256": "1d1bc28c78b3d715c96f186d75aedcd9b7d74e02746bcaf155754626a1eb6c5a",
      "translation": "那么，让我介绍一下我们的阿维斯运输队。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:9341d9c3fa0f5a1de6c7d0ba9ee11c8927a46163283d2a8e3b51fb9c951af19a",
      "source_sha256": "875623ea8ab49947646784694b756a430d1137db539929536ade6f640e90b63e",
      "translation": "我们的阿维斯运输队，会舒舒服服地将客人送往兰兹海姆的主要地区。当然，安全送达也是最基本的要求啦～",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:530c552f1f20b56e9ce4960ac5ac4651b5a3d418fa0e1ac41751f36ecfea60f1",
      "source_sha256": "9de5b47899e570684e5cd50cae239a9cce82413ac0d83fa50c123d06d9919092",
      "translation": "所以，交战地区或者被判定为危险的地方，我们运输队也去不了。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:82eaa855fdc9c9e9bdbf9b2d5461f6a75573c5551c89eb4b1a2cdc18e28b69e4",
      "source_sha256": "bb3956b701a3261e97f9b545e4e6e66b88502d744b300fbd9f2151fb4af5f5ef",
      "translation": "以后只要在晶柱附近找到我们阿维斯族，就能随时使用运输队。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:c6fcc9b5d9c4cc6b0a6dc982a0bc1b25c70acf5e2597e9bebe1370e8dd1f2882",
      "source_sha256": "404275d0e667cc502fb4f8b373dede7506a9a24008d034d4ea290bf7eaf5e012",
      "translation": "此外，我们还独立经营着商店。有需要的话，也欢迎光顾。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:a77455e7501659aa1b79274dee24befd8cc0ab9ef23a5b1c0d0f56bcb1384898",
      "source_sha256": "72aae9a7d1bb12640040ebd3d31241955c737ea50ddae6edd8a8b4d8e37bcf17",
      "translation": "现在情况紧急，就由我暂时代办运输队的业务。下次请找晶柱前的阿维斯族人就行。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:db31ee1cbbbb6f08e7dba804a5e82cc2d6aecf3f5f3583d7d80873f9d03d4657",
      "source_sha256": "6bb3309c790265de43c292fd7b29c49ab391100cf16ef918126b81a6d3c94624",
      "translation": "谢谢你帮忙，伊格顿。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:2711274eba8bd0b1f1da3a3cd0ebc9c2085da90367b6adab4e185ca1591e9f39",
      "source_sha256": "b03d4fd7a1b07e028102d2dddcd1506dd4d3d811bc046f77870371e34d102ea9",
      "translation": "这件事结束后，我就要和各位告别了。以后请找晶柱旁的阿维斯族人帮忙吧。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:67562fffaa5b49bd43b05c207441656413080ab3c213ade36fed74fd8ec82ec6",
      "source_sha256": "e8d35a0c9963f70b3228a6703ebfca6e54053c1984601a509040b78b77606dd9",
      "translation": "知道了。那么，向贝尔福特出发吧。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:68f0e1b76402b47dd7211b1318dacf4571f714b2694a864ee0bdbf668bfc5fce",
      "source_sha256": "080576d9f0b28f9b28677a973d7639baefd6ecfc2323c7191a674097262fa1ec",
      "translation": "该怎么走？"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:4c6a0176927af39264842514a3b8a5688ef04d47b99bf2d064bc4a2a51cc5b59",
      "source_sha256": "5b309f96de054ee9b05f1d92914edd94287771256043efd65f7b67f832f647c8",
      "translation": "去贝尔福特，需要经过杜南平原和鲁哈尔特。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:2e052d70eee13836ca68761c72006092aae0e898c6a5f91338ee54403a03ded2",
      "source_sha256": "ec6a3110ef3be30b17b3c0c54113e73d4ecf5e4ff6acefc28df9597eede026c9",
      "translation": "鲁哈尔特盆地的北边，与王都贝尔福特相连。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:ca6b5ccab5524261cc2ffe6e50768311c557154ef7fe4279a161b93ce6115065",
      "source_sha256": "251ebfac0608738dc1a96068224587b41872a505b70a799cd467273b375bf70c",
      "translation": "好，那就快走吧～"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:72453e3fec377cabe83bdff5c1368e1eb8b3442db2a20155eaaef9969ffd7675",
      "source_sha256": "c19ec0ae66d135291abc55f710b0303e81bb33474321689cae2543ee43326b1d",
      "translation": "(都是因为我，连同伴们也……必须解开误会。)",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:22c323fe57271fa938cc72e5f564b39219b707aabb1dd0cd9c295329a6d859cb",
      "source_sha256": "8ccebb9e5c41e9c4e2ee326a7047fb88420dff520754a2a5f7a820142862d37a",
      "translation": "(有些不对劲。不能就这样走。)",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:e5ea7f131c4e931b2da5494d73a02642b20cb5134ac7d0d8bf5c3be2d4b84e79",
      "source_sha256": "6339f4d73f67555440d00726833bb626aaaf4a9c90dcd904d14634bde9fc2028",
      "translation": "(南部军为什么要拦住我们？不能就这样走。)",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:936242bc473f71984668719741f1e7d67410e613c02dcf6c15c453e8136c6f11",
      "source_sha256": "25076362c8561525725980f10a4a185793363fbd9fc1fa502de1a61a45a54543",
      "translation": "(有太多奇怪的地方了。不能就这样过去。)",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:20ed64b8f517f824d399d296e54af813441d7af4e106c634d356ffee9c5b855c",
      "source_sha256": "c48641b4ccce7fd2df0ad18dbf4bd9d87024d89fb1667618f1218a6329db8c1c",
      "translation": "(南部军竟敢拦住我们，必须给他们点颜色看看。)",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:89d8f1afef51fc33c9102afe38df4761813c613769994bffca60d41ad0e5c6bf",
      "source_sha256": "9544c7c9afc1620f9e0fd55fdb71f8f3709b46e3f2c50e5a19b9e406cbae424b",
      "translation": "想去哪里？"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:153651fc4bbbe7e9281f627cd115a2a43fe3b77c8c011a523c069b394d5f2eae",
      "source_sha256": "268d5443a098926f7d27e6069af16c69bd82825dc4a6921cac5f775288589b6f",
      "translation": "欢迎使用阿维斯运输队～"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:30bb443a8e23dae465e6c7cd4eaac4c964c6ae4be2d0ae142883c0d0ae5dc578",
      "source_sha256": "fdd4e76f490b2aeeb65ef9f712d4027ea3865692a7ad5671041215af5c70222e",
      "translation": "阿维斯运输队"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:801d9d027eb3f6426e962ed2761182fde6a091d8d8465ad641f112038fd9e2e4",
      "source_sha256": "0364e6860c855db0055795024d67846ee5578573e5f4920126c51442c9760f18",
      "translation": "阿维斯运输队乘车券"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:076fe7af00d0341a8eee329eea85e9529d9749f447cf4986e2029bc1f0b79041",
      "source_sha256": "83a177286274f1d4428b8da3f1c746ca27f97ccf6f2692e1e9a365f5e58f3000",
      "translation": "可终身免费使用阿维斯运输队的乘车券"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:c64277da1abb90f64d8189bcd896ed47c474ad2da608be4b6eba4df95cadfb35",
      "source_sha256": "18b4dcb5845da4f2eb4a7badbac55688ddef2414bbac2d317e887f6e43984d0f",
      "translation": "离开阿维斯运输队"
    },
    {
